      "t": "Night market and lantern walk",
      "zone": "article"
    },
    {
      "inMain": true,
      "k": "p",
      "links": 0,
      "t": "On the last evening of the festival, the harbour wall turns into a night market with forty stalls of local food, crafts and books. At nine o'clock, a walk of paper lanterns leaves the market and follows the quay to the old lifeboat station.",
      "zone": "article"
    },
    {
