      "zone": "article"
    },
    {
      "inMain": true,
      "k": "li",
      "links": 0,
      "t": "Free entry. Lantern kits cost £4 at the welcome tent.",
      "zone": "article"
    },
    {
      "inMain": true,
      "k": "h",
      "level": 2,
      "links": 0,
      "t": "Make your own lantern",
      "zone": "article"
    },
    {
      "inMain": true,
      "k": "p",
      "links": 0,
      "t": "Children can make a lantern at the workshop tent from 18:00. Each kit has a willow frame, tissue paper and a battery light. The workshop closes at 20:30 so the glue can dry before the walk.",
      "zone": "article"
    },
    {
      "inMain": true,
      "k": "h",
      "level": 2,
      "links": 0,
      "t": "Access",
      "zone": "article"
    },
    {
      "inMain": true,
      "k": "p",
      "links": 0,
      "t": "The harbour wall is flat but has some uneven stones. A quiet area with seats is next to the harbour office. If it rains hard, the lantern walk moves to Sunday at the same time.",
      "zone": "article"
    },
    {
